     A          R HPLIST
     A                                  1  2'Help - Phone book'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'Your own contacts, in name order. -
     A                                       The card on the right shows one en-
     A                                      try.'
     A                                  5  3'Type part of a name, number or not-
     A                                      e in Find and press Enter to search-
     A                                      .'
     A                                  6  3'Put the cursor on a letter of the -
     A                                      alphabet line and press Enter to li-
     A                                      st'
     A                                  7  3'only names starting with it.  The -
     A                                      * at the end shows every name again-
     A                                      .'
     A                                  9  3'Options: 5 shows the card, 2 chang-
     A                                      es an entry, 4 deletes it.'
     A                                 10  3'Cursor on a name and Enter also sh-
     A                                      ows its card.'
     A                                 12  3'F6 adds an entry.  F9 prints the p-
     A                                      hone book.'
     A                                 13  3'F7 and F8 page backward and forwar-
     A                                      d through a long list.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
